{"id":"C21783a05396572128faa","zh":"钢轨磨耗","en":"rail wear","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","definition_zh":"钢轨表面在重复轮轨作用下发生的材料损失及型面改变。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":"在轨道状态研究中作为考察对象，用于分析轮轨接触造成的钢轨材料损失与曲线半径的关系，比较不同曲线条件下的磨耗情况。","translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C21783a05396572128faa","zh":"钢轨磨耗","en":"rail wear","domain":"轨道不平顺与信号处理","group_id":"H902b4513847a574915af","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道不平顺与信号处理 · 陈宪麦等（2015）"}],"designations":[{"id":"Dc53bc31f68624b211b3b","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"钢轨磨耗"},{"id":"Dcef531ebfb93592bf301","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"rail wear"}],"sources":{"P104":{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sdc3594ef75bdd7f7c366","source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"en","text":"With the methods of site investigation, testing and calculation analysis, useful discussions of rail wear, Sanzhe, rail breaking and initial deflection, parameters of fastener and rail joint bolt torque, service state and geometric parameters of ballast bed, cold damage, track irregularity, are proposed.","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S7da49049888362783e66","source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"采用现场调研、测试和计算分析等研究方法,对滨洲线的钢轨磨耗、三折、断轨和原始弯曲,扣件参数及接头螺栓扭矩,道床状态参数和几何参数,线路冻害和轨道不平顺等线路状态进行深入分析,总结滨洲线轨道状态之特征和变化规律,并提出养护维修之对策。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S21240a52f0e3de0914a0","source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"1.1 钢轨磨耗钢轨直接承受车轮荷载和病害区引发的冲击作用,磨耗的产生是难以避免的。","citations":[{"source_id":"P104","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C375215c4a3112e120cd1","target_concept_id":"C375215c4a3112e120cd1","target_zh":"接头螺栓扭矩","target_en":"rail joint bolt torque","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C0f671887c4151b3e46fc","target_concept_id":"C0f671887c4151b3e46fc","target_zh":"原始弯曲","target_en":"initial deflection","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_concept_id":"Cd6d4ea1d7e05aa0361f7","target_zh":"轨道不平顺","target_en":"track irregularity","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C547af7ba4e6c18f54f2b","target_concept_id":"C547af7ba4e6c18f54f2b","target_zh":"断轨","target_en":"rail breaking","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C20a250d00d217006057c","target_concept_id":"C20a250d00d217006057c","target_zh":"运营状态","target_en":"service state","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cf50644019af4da5a2a8a","target_concept_id":"Cf50644019af4da5a2a8a","target_zh":"养护维修","target_en":"maintenance","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P104","title":"滨州线轨道状态及养护维修对策研究","authors":"陈宪麦,贺天龙,刘胜勇,张向民,徐磊,马子祥,王卫东","year":"2015","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.2015.06.007","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"陈宪麦等（2015）","overview_slug":"2015-research-on-track-service-state-and-maintenance-responses-of-harbin-manzhouli-railway"}]}